        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Is the buffer-tag/sattelite flickering related to cursor movement or just flickering? (it's easiest to see in neovide with cursor animations) I tried buffer-tag and I see flickering on scroll and window change, but I believe it is because it [closes and re-opens the windows](https://github.com/ldelossa/buffertag/blob/095df2edafa8a1491da06bbe80c4fa87f9c9a176/lua/buffertag/init.lua#L81-L88) which happens [on WinScrolled](https://github.com/ldelossa/buffertag/blob/095df2edafa8a1491da06bbe80c4fa87f9c9a176/lua/buffertag/init.lua#L107), so I think this is not related to the cursor-jump issue (maybe reusing existing windows could fix flickering). Not sure about the sattelite.nvim.",
